###  https://purl.archive.org/nudging#location_attributes_framework
<https://purl.archive.org/nudging#location_attributes_framework> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                          <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dul/DUL.owl#Theory> ;
                                                                 rdfs:comment """Most significant attributes of location are: 
a) regarding BE: built density, proximity to transport networks, open space and green area, land use mix (residential and commercial); 
b) regarding point of interests (POI): education, retail, recreation and sport, transportation facilities, urban amenities; 
c) for socioeconomic environment: population density, household types (size, working or not, families or not), origin or race, incomes, density of jobs, school quality; and 
d) for employment accessibility: generally a gravity measure."""@en ;
                                                                 rdfs:label "location attributes framework" .


